{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1321,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d77c0247e78bc34b2efec8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘイ、トレーナー！調子はどう？\r\n私は好調すぎてトレーニングが\r\n待ちきれないわ！ダンシンッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efa6cfda207dc4ede7412078eec42e79a989db7f0919e17948b397810967cfd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:320ff9318ddaf01ffe59991b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界を変える者にも休息は必要よ。\r\n今度私の情熱ソング弾き語り音源を\r\n…お休みBGMとして進呈するわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5808bc1cc63ec1aa356ed40988406b665522f6e78154fea461b3f2ecacc91fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4657552621cdbe3e94c050ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スプリングスリープ…春の眠りは\r\n心地いいというけれど。毎日快眠の\r\n私には関係なかったわね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22664c2e3c155c95ecf38f4db00b9fb06bf3d756d95a1dac4e5f54c29f2d117f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf7e11175d23d079869de059",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏のレースは大変だけど、好きよ。\r\n何か世界を変える大きな事を\r\n見せられそうな気がするから♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "88c67fc619beb9d46b67614cd38c60ea88210662c5eec148440f37fe4c37cac3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0db825ab38a6db7e41432d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜が長くなってくる時期よね。\r\n私もよく窓辺で考え事をするの…\r\n今度の遠征はどの弁当にするかを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29225908daeac0f3ed76e797a262eab9f81f7461ded7322c3a253041f7bc162c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59316e2f53a4c44a68878b40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなに寒くても、私の走りで…\r\n溢れるパッションで温めるわ♪\r\nそれがファビュラス・パールよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5c90593f7d6d50e020fc7e77f57db5745e8b1d0cfb9f3b34e9035526c89ee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6bb68a77a12fdb6bf1bc6eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流れ星さえ従えて、大地を見下ろす\r\n輝き1つ。夜空にたなびく軌跡を\r\n見つけたら…それは私かも、ね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c945820436a675d688382cffae1a567e63fea4df88d5503ef1825d1496e2f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b73b6816c089b58705b8d713",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミステリアス…＆エレガンツッ！\r\n魔女と星空の旅はいかがかしら？\r\n貴方なら連れて行ってあげるわよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "54427fdddbe1a62941c8e6059cf7627cb977814d53aeea41f1875ce4102c40d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2dbb466c0af189274b37001",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，active地向前进！\r\n以世界为目标努力训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee5741f454bfe850c84020744bc9864c214b4bce9ad03f7bae2123722d667f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e6e5c271f720545bd7cf6fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd6cea31bb2ba5a7a34cc6f72aedf60a9538d8f61dd5fddc60e275e5043f039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9641ffcb6e487aac755f80a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "珍珠是因为珍珠质层经过层层累积\r\n才终于能散发光芒……\r\n也是因此越变越big的喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dc779db939b5144a2f5e3dce488525a2118aedf940292868bf28d2127f257b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1189941153287ed390291d32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我事先做好warm-up跟\r\n采珠式冥想了。\r\n来吧，here we go♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f0419101059446f2ad1053ab347825f743e21c42b075f848cc0229749164a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ff7d3075d605874b66f9fca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越努力训练就会越期待\r\nbathtime呢♪\r\n好啦，我要挥洒shine的汗水～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be9523585ece42f7dead3abffdca6c915b2fdedbcb94c9f1133c1a15706a2e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2c61d5e694abfa0b425c32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，come on！\r\n让我看看你的heart！\r\n你想好进军世界的plan了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8d2f488f9f08d98225da652fc639bda2a4ab04bb5b27fbe7dd268c9efb7f3c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b63db09e20b9032b7d164d41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要交给你就一定没问题。\r\n我会相信你的判断不断奔跑……！\r\n好啦，今天也要加油喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "294b831b95d7a82afd6354196744b29380f080dfac817473db60c48faa14b612",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3110179c44182bc8b8b7d76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我就是最高级的花珠珍珠……！\r\n由你亲手打磨完成的最顶级宝石。\r\n呵呵……你要让我更加闪耀喔……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "824232cbb6d58afebf0fa31284e09eefad427d4fc44579dfe0a2bf59ee14516e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97f1d8bd85ff70c1ba255ec5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "练习结束后我会喝碗fresh的海鲜汤\r\ncharge水分跟盐分！\r\n呵呵……疲劳瞬间一扫而空♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ba301fcb0f03a32450f4548c3d76a48995346f54f5688014303765abeb89da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33d066b4e6b9a24c56716e52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フィジカル・イズ・マ～ジカルッ！\r\n極限まで磨き上げた走りは魔法と\r\n区別がつかないわ！アンダスタン？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a1e2f8032c6eed2d0bc93f308a24a365d75d34cbb2f3e45b123452f8c675739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59428ef49c318a592c980503",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界中に無限の可能性を示すっ！\r\n魔女ならそのくらいはやらなきゃ、\r\nエレガントとは言えないわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "264590eb9e4b32efba5a8716d1bace74d5614aea13432e15d7cc16cb3e82844d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7470f4116e17aed378dfc85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ンッフフ～♪来たわねトレーナー！\r\nイメトレは万全よ！レースから\r\nウイニングライブまで！フッフ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e852a7fabb5f40a3454bb649668be38e508a3005960efd7162bc48bd55792c6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d28631f3e5745256c000a2cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水分以外に塩分補給もマスト要件！\r\n消化吸収にもいい赤出汁味噌汁よ。\r\n貴方の分も作ってきてあげたわっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d17bbf43c75e80fe7ea4132b7beafd7d27ac789a9c9933636b3d9296d3f1b832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a7f53a8107c747d522fd7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今ならロケットエンジンさえ\r\n敵ではないわ。ディス地球だって\r\n90分で1周できるくらいに、ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce419262fdac4767469694722b94c06c3a653d2511335d5a5f8e2bf6e7176b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2811727bfa96a7dcc47bb7e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『不可能を可能にする魔法』…。\r\nそれは自分を疑わない者の力よ！\r\nビリービンッ・インフィニティッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99523f6a4b1656a0d00d3ab2d17a07d82278fd947ed3a944b19b8f7ad282ae17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:844f00858cf7baa57e519616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私という真珠は貴方によって輝き…\r\n流星のように眩しく世界を照らす。\r\nン～、ザッツワンダフルマジック！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca7b3bf1cba6554615c4ce2858f0c4397e6d5d6f283c8ec4415cf58b08ee7c7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f84999ccf5dfa4076af48eea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "My dear！都要感谢你的支持！",
      "source_fingerprint": "839152486f94e868a5fe2b629db09108b5eb3bb50f43c31d9a3f33337a9aa9c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1566d0f7ca76bd8e1b3d40df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Amazing！挑战世界之路还没结束！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a304b64cd676fc6b8e8fc851eb906601ad1c9022e1d95ac2efba9f247ef893d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1cb23a714b531f1ae1c3875",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私たちなら…銀河の果てにさえ辿り着けるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b95c3d3c80ac8f07158688a57f3ead5b3e58d237bb29f24e2a8d832bef99c722",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d7fff6ebef54894da61668c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファビュラスマジ～ック！楽しめた？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41b1fbbb1bb9d9e8388a433699c31c4b0d2bba0a704d83b4a41c84ab11fc562d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b39ddf6f34af86bc68c648e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要更加更加shine！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3431a079e82021f151d631f51378e856d3ca965eacf345e9210d2209e18435f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5904f1e8baa321343f1563a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes☆超越极限……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb01b7a77961d5109c7277d0fb67dd35439951532384873f7ff10bf6818910e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e8ed17de3e32729a7000a9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～！我叫做采珠喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab4252e289a070000cb33401671534810c96d602ea784b496dad65b6c171d7f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65749b760bcc264bed763798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想要的是金色珍珠？还是\r\n银色珍珠？嗯～或者是……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee7a1f9a3c19c6c9fa59eea8174a6628cd505df73aef8c930315f797cda6e11c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aec97bafe8e2e3612907e0ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没错，还要再更加耀眼……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3766ee1ea416b7d6d5ae1a5e0cdb1fdc3430755d6322b83919a1c51ee4a321fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:163e697afa653935c7101d2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就是世界级的水平了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed7b0f083db16d6cbff08728204fa9819bd68591ad59e9edcc68bafc14c3bcd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66b0f43fe4e6678f7bb1d85e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の魔力…高まってきたわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ecded644ecfd3a784fc8e8ec6286f3ea2ef160c5d60b70f1cc98ff0166dcb21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc058d1ad01d69aa77892c9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パールの魔法に…\r\n限界はナッシンッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c88b1c9d1fd97f0e7893e0077cbdad1ad72c3181d2e43d53d7d47ecb29b68d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f63d0a86618b6d40aabb5ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の魔法は…\r\n世界さえ塗り替えるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28664f030dd681a85a2fcd5fbfbfd9876ba3e6adf3be171bb4045dcfa1eed95b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c871f2a11513823eb39a61fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ンッン～♪魔女シーキングザパールよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6636b9b8b9872ab5ed27378074b3b7d6f7ad181d3d9fed1f6d0b675d1e28ddae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12985bb838aeed293cace6c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一口气向前咬！",
      "source_fingerprint": "daf544a0feaa093887ac76c224c71b25778a97997c516210b64839e9149ba907",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab83f13d737128eaf4f8b02a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风是最强最棒的！\r\n不过……最先注意到这一点的你\r\n实力也算不赖啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b924d6a9c1ef80e433367459dd5bcc11e71ff57387b2e7390af9f58c6f4ee591",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:139d5ab3286a0ca9ae5e65fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるのだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecfa6f2a9fbd62300178208e1db094da30ca1882946a0529810e5ceb85dc4bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3936d34b072b317a4bc71527",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったのだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3301b90602a739d7aa1e050365eb4d3b0345ff8174d90a7127f95dac1464955",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:803355b4d5ebd6569cc50e16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出差前一定要事先告诉风风\r\n预定行程喔！要不然……对了！\r\n不然风风就要占领训练员室喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f293cfdf23c73290fb57731542ece0f8e239eaad8479c2f16dc5e84d37653c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f081212a780fe9d8fe807e75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有烦恼都要说出来喔。\r\n风风会活用自己的创意\r\n来帮你的忙喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60062ddf63322ca4978b4bff85598e43e113f2877cf1cf0f26b66de3677e1bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e56eb591b256d21efab64f61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风的好伙伴小舞狮\r\n今年也大大活跃了一番喔！\r\n你也来被咬一口吧～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "046492346846d3f2d9391963f87691d554de6335b5a6696da589d0e2eeb380bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeb161a882e95b65af92456c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "班上同学说「非要」送给风风，\r\n所以风风才收下的喔！那个……\r\n好像叫友情巧克力的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5680b71914c1b412a760980c862f96718b745f03abe4ab82089061ea6179ba4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ad211465ab98a82d95975a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风准备了特制巧克力要给你！\r\n味道辣辣的，吃了会流眼泪……\r\n所以还一起准备了牛奶喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "161116d6d434257f543e1d21db3f52451d430214e360ca3ad413e4ea0a3d12a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f068f2181c022ff8ff33a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘻嘻嘻！风风把签纸全～都移到\r\n最上面了喔！风风要让大家\r\n都无法再看一次自己许的愿望喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57662e307353d3f2c8e222a2952e6dca915962f20113e7b54b158355ae2e6bf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:216e6cc089a3345a8b3949e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想知道怎么恶作剧吗？\r\n真是的～今天到处都有人找风风，\r\n整个忙到不行喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "727a8ca4b681db5336269e5a883dddb1901a3f0b38bdbd1ff7f28f893c8c896e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10b71133c007fd299b00f5b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人会送微光\r\n什么样的正义道具啊？\r\n身为大坏蛋得先想好对策才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b50c2a604357366d666d5c1535d5014548da2db95fe007ef106984196139c91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7836c5feaa541ee129f027d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烤鸡！蛋糕！玉米！\r\n全都准备两人份放到训练员室！\r\n办派对要用的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef76aeca6ee2494dae255aa72089e189215fd7c9fff5d7db1cf458757d5e67bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83435c9daf047d659bf043f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b96b9e826362454acd03a8f71045f158301e7e41ca2cb3cb8b6a7bd4655564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ed19c4a9bc52dfcbefcdebd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒假永远不要来也没关系啦。\r\n冬天没什么猎物……实在太无聊了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b7d5c2249218f096664c44eeb42808cbdb83903c050586e6fe05f2dc1089844",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f1f68ef2bc1f51eaa1b7709",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是你生日啊？\r\n那你一定会去吃美味料理吧！？\r\n带上风风一起去～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c66d639feb29025c9892a6bed1ba96619cf6c842e2aa6dd33c46f6c8074ae90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b44601e3b8cdefcdc298fd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有没有什么想做的事啊？\r\n风风可以听看看喔。\r\n只限今天风风才愿意听喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c1fd5be50aa146c4f641eaa6b84e87719b2cf7a5a57b1e8ecf4b197bb3ec4b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecb8beeeedaf30e8b905f152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是什么日子！？没错！\r\n正是风风的生日喔！\r\n还不快用力赞美风风～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9c5a4e8cc0001dc01e58e828a108df104fca16669498ecb8b46aa914ccb959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd329fb417855c7c2a91648b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "采珠前辈她们要帮风风办庆生会喔！\r\n作为风风的手下，\r\n你也要心怀感激地来祝福风风！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cab313e5f4cd39c8ee894c8665ef73bae37f0a02e83503d2561cd4e2e094a4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acd5c5025c64ac00a9bc9314",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有新公告喔！\r\n命令你代替风风仔细～地看完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "290a06e12a0925a54d469e1a78bd25cabbf2b20593dccf05810762a3ebe9a3af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc4f49075e4d8ec0c4a10c87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了喔！\r\n等不及了……快点交出来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c181073b5b2ec6ef6b0e74f7d71cb237674a8e9c950a638b04dd59bf75030c79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f1cb0e10a5d96012c3f9beb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务了喔！\r\n这也全都是风风的功劳喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d45b3a84ae21e0b2445b2a66369e83f03f55ed44e57eb7599e156d9369fc7bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17813abd3f9457d5cb9ed465",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔，活动预告！\r\n风风感到有机会可以恶作剧了喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6c4aa6d616070c2eb7272ec1f6a3f2c742253db74aa79890db273bb75b0bf33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27014685dac11008a010e74c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始啰！\r\n动作快，风风想快点去玩啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38cbe093dd37d1da8db84fc48c56e0ac18076f6478d9f747bd9babd05cbf936b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a04975b72ac4bcf4452221e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4506dd0d7bfa26ae7a66f0e6e3326dbcb7eac9950470ae3cad7d60a0d0a5d8f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6047d1c5bbc5a4b87447b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册等级上升！呵呵♪\r\n手下的成果就是老大的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db79c5b6bb5970072e574820c49ad028bce673821b16fa3c66c2f491639211eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54497cc472986b2a70718c67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "にししっ、ポッケがおっきいと\r\nいたずら道具も入れ放題なのだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3c722406d152580443300d427a2f890aa5d5248f0c5cb1cfa34aa83c19378ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45af203cd8392e8919164cb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白いと汚れが目立つからいいって\r\nお母さんが言ってたのだ！元気\r\nいっぱいで、ニコニコになるって！",
      "source_fingerprint": "690a5e910494c707cf640facca291246fbb7037d9b5f79dff0969c0c885c51ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da33834ebab94942d051d5ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も『肉厚ジューシーバーガー』\r\n食べに行くぞ！お前のおごりだと\r\n特に美味しいからな！へへっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "875e462c2f2c9648671090430a1c30671c78579229d633e70a4983483324a95d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bcc23e9b6834204c4e2bfb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4d411669abf1d8a4eb549250647aa9fbb1430b3fa6f89f6f05e0ddc57926381",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bfc8f45909dbd2258f976b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乖乖投降吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b1ffde17737b55d7e43aaf02a1575f27ce18224ec7d5589f6cc1a1fdf9e2b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15d9356aa7e0f08f223b45ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔哇！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4506dd0d7bfa26ae7a66f0e6e3326dbcb7eac9950470ae3cad7d60a0d0a5d8f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f264fa21ae798b2ffa832d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4d411669abf1d8a4eb549250647aa9fbb1430b3fa6f89f6f05e0ddc57926381",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd633e8d2a2d93a8d93ab44a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新高分纪录了喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f480c885a2c9d723662d34313c3c0a5a07cd87678520056181f04efb26083e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e120f3f56c73a33fa56a42f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手下们，上啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39a82c038323f87273503ac1e44aa0af9cf3da920803b66bd719ed8b3f88db59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27538ea111fe1de950f7c6dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんないたずらを…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc10e101979023ba652b1a0b612d783bf92fefb065eef56b1892dc6da6a18687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fa28d9982530bdd50172763",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风要大口咬下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0472c99a2b1621f1cb7a071fe1be94e05733956603d85f2a0f7fa338cff0d5ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b8eb9e62fab1e411d483846",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c71bf51cc6e38ea2f643bfea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风风要来试试\r\n用在训练上的恶作剧喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a96ab245aa03b2a41c6f10637f338a51934acdb6e73fe16193436ac8333c7567",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203f23669d3b9b48606260fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这本书看起来\r\n好像有咬一口的价值喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a28e0021b41de72ef5f977d6800dbfa0afb48badd7aacbac97d1071e56ab14b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01e9013d4660f9667cf224fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让风风参赛啦！\r\n风风想大闹一场啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "487319dbd00015f18b979409015f2829840133f2fb06f783935c21b2de6bf856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c79783fa6e5a6f280fbe7906",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2d8bfa60dd0b93804b6f0e1b99dfc49d01cebafd6dac9df7fd909eb89d81055",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1043",
        "1192"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
